        "Completion suppresses hints but preserves spans; validation diagnostics may coexist; output/resize preserve valid display",
        "Plain spans degrade without altering canonical text; hints retain explicit non-canonical delimiters and never submit",
        "Linux/macOS real PTY and native memory qualification; Windows portable model only"
      ],
